The search identifies the defect as CFTR ΔF508 (p.Phe508del), a cystic-fibrosis-causing CFTR trafficking mutation. I will now store the central mechanistic finding: loss of CFTR-mediated chloride secretion is accompanied by increased ENaC-mediated sodium absorption in airway epithelium.

